sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI Adapter
    participant CM as New CodeManager
    participant GH as GitHubDownloader
    participant GitHub as api.github.com
    participant Archive as codeload.github.com
    participant Reader as Shared ZIP Reader
    participant Registry as ProjectRegistry
    User->>API: POST GitHub root URL and optional projectName
    API->>CM: loadGit(url)
    CM->>GH: Validate URL and fetch within overall deadline
    GH->>GitHub: GET repository metadata, optional API-only token
    GitHub-->>GH: Public metadata and actual default_branch
    GH->>GitHub: GET zipball for default_branch
    GitHub-->>GH: Controlled HTTPS archive redirect
    GH->>Archive: GET bounded ZIP without Authorization
    Archive-->>GH: Archive bytes
    GH-->>CM: Archive, canonical name, known wrapper prefix
    CM->>Reader: Validate archive and remove known GitHub wrapper
    Reader->>Reader: Preserve nested paths and decode original source
    Reader-->>CM: Sorted SourceFile list
    CM->>CM: Validate candidate and replace project
    CM-->>API: List of SourceFile
    API->>CM: getProject()
    CM-->>API: PyProject
    API->>Registry: Atomic capacity check and register snapshot
    Registry-->>API: Registered
    API-->>User: HTTP 201 project JSON
    Note over API,Registry: Any acquisition, decoding, deadline, or capacity error returns mapped JSON; prior projects remain
